### ====================================================================
### EdVyro Careers - REST API Examples (Milestone 3)
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client, IntelliJ/Aqua HTTP Client, etc.
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. INTERNSHIPS: LIST & PAGINATION
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 List all internships (Default pagination: page 1, limit 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 List internships with custom pagination (page 1, limit 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships?page=1&limit=3
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 List internships with limit exceeding maximum (capped at 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships?limit=100
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. INTERNSHIPS: SEARCH & FILTERING
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Search by keyword (title, domain, location, or skills)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships?search=frontend
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Filter by domain (e.g. UI/UX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships?domain=UI/UX
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Filter by work mode (Remote | Hybrid | On-site)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships?mode=Hybrid
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 Combined search and filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships?search=engineer&domain=Full%20Stack%20Development&mode=Hybrid
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. INTERNSHIPS: GET BY ID
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Get internship by ID (Success: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/INT-101
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Get internship by ID (Error: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/INT-999
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. INTERNSHIPS: CREATE (POST)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Create new internship (Success: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Cloud DevOps Intern",
  "domain": "Cloud Computing",
  "mode": "Remote",
  "location": "India",
  "skills": ["AWS", "Docker", "Kubernetes"],
  "openings": 2,
  "description": "Collaborate with cloud architects to maintain CI/CD pipelines and Kubernetes clusters.",
  "stipend": "₹32,000 / month",
  "duration": "6 Months"
}

### 4.2 Create internship validation error - Missing required fields (Error: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Incomplete Intern"
}

### 4.3 Create internship validation error - Reject unknown fields (Error: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Machine Learning Intern",
  "domain": "Artificial Intelligence",
  "mode": "Remote",
  "location": "Bengaluru",
  "skills": ["Python", "TensorFlow"],
  "openings": 1,
  "unauthorizedField": "malicious payload",
  "unexpectedKey": 123
}

### 4.4 Create internship validation error - Invalid mode enum (Error: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "QA Engineer Intern",
  "domain": "Software Testing",
  "mode": "In-Office",
  "location": "Mumbai",
  "skills": ["Cypress", "Jest"],
  "openings": 1
}

### 4.5 Create internship validation error - Negative openings (Error: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "QA Engineer Intern",
  "domain": "Software Testing",
  "mode": "Remote",
  "location": "Mumbai",
  "skills": ["Cypress", "Jest"],
  "openings": -5
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. INTERNSHIPS: UPDATE (PUT)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Update existing internship (Success: 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/INT-102
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Lead API Engineering Intern",
  "openings": 4,
  "mode": "Remote",
  "stipend": "₹35,000 / month"
}

### 5.2 Update non-existent internship (Error: 404 Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/INT-999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Phantom Internship"
}

### 5.3 Update internship validation error - Invalid field values (Error: 400 Bad Request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/INT-102
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "openings": -2
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. INTERNSHIPS: DELETE (DELETE)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Delete existing internship (Success: 200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/INT-004
Accept: application/json

### 6.2 Delete non-existent internship (Error: 404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/INT-999
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. APPLICATIONS: SUBMISSION & VALIDATION
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Submit candidate application (Success: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "internshipId": "INT-101",
  "fullName": "Aarav Mehta",
  "email": "aarav.mehta@university.edu",
  "portfolioUrl": "https://github.com/aaravmehta",
  "whyYou": "Passionate frontend developer with demonstrated React, modern CSS, and component design experience."
}

### 7.2 Submit duplicate application for same role + email (Error: 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "internshipId": "INT-101",
  "fullName": "Aarav Mehta Again",
  "email": "aarav.mehta@university.edu",
  "portfolioUrl": "https://github.com/aaravmehta",
  "whyYou": "Attempting to submit duplicate application."
}

### 7.3 Submit application with invalid email format (Error: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "internshipId": "INT-101",
  "fullName": "Pooja Patel",
  "email": "not-a-valid-email-format"
}

### 7.4 Submit application with unsafe URL scheme (Error: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "internshipId": "INT-101",
  "fullName": "Security Candidate",
  "email": "sec@university.edu",
  "portfolioUrl": "javascript:alert('XSS_ATTACK')"
}

### 7.5 Submit application for unknown internship ID (Error: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "internshipId": "INT-FAKEROLE-999",
  "fullName": "Valid Candidate",
  "email": "candidate@university.edu"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. GLOBAL ERROR HANDLING & 404 ROUTE
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1 Malformed JSON payload (Error: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "invalid_json": true,

### 8.2 Unknown route 404 JSON response (Error: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/non-existent-endpoint
Accept: application/json
